\title{deli: M-Estimation and Empirical Sandwich Variance Estimation}
\description{
Solves estimating equations to obtain M-estimators together with empirical sandwich variance estimates, providing a general interface for both custom and built-in estimating equations. Built-in equations cover basic statistics, regression, causal inference, survival analysis, measurement error, and more. Methods follow Stefanski and Boos (2002) \doi{10.1198/000313002753631330} and Boos and Stefanski (2013) \doi{10.1007/978-1-4614-4818-1_7}. An 'R' port of the 'Python' library 'delicatessen' described in Zivich et al. (2022) \doi{10.48550/arXiv.2203.11300}.
}
